@startuml use-case-records-admin
title Use-Case Diagram 2 – Medical Records & Administration
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F4FAF9
  BorderColor #0E6E68
}
skinparam actorBorderColor #0E6E68

actor Doctor
actor Patient
actor Admin

rectangle "Healthcare Appointment & Patient Record System" {
  usecase "Open patient chart" as R1
  usecase "Verify care relationship" as R1a
  usecase "Write consultation notes" as R2
  usecase "Issue prescription" as R3
  usecase "Edit record\n(new version)" as R4
  usecase "View own medical history" as R5
  usecase "Download prescription PDF" as R6
  usecase "Record in audit log" as RL
  usecase "Manage staff accounts" as A1
  usecase "Manage doctor profiles" as A2
  usecase "View dashboard" as A3
  usecase "Export CSV report" as A4
}

Doctor --> R1
Doctor --> R2
Doctor --> R3
Doctor --> R4
Patient --> R5
Patient --> R6
Admin --> A1
Admin --> A2
Admin --> A3
Admin --> A4
R1 .> R1a : <<include>>
R1 .> RL : <<include>>
R2 <.. R4 : <<extend>>
note right of RL
  Every chart view, record change,
  prescription, account change and
  export writes an audit entry
  (HAP-SR-007).
end note
@enduml
